MEMORANDUM
TO:

Mayor Patrick Collins, and City Council
FROM:

TJ Barttelbort, Purchasing Manager
DATE:

September 20, 2023
SUBJECT:
Consideration of Bid #S-3-24 for an Agreement between the City of Cheyenne and
Reiman Corp, Inc. for the Yellowstone Road and Central Avenue Concrete Repairs
project
 ______________________________________________
Bid #S-3-24 was solicited for the Yellowstone Road and Central Avenue Concrete Repairs.
Project vicinity map included.

Three (3) bidders responded to this bid, and the bid tabulation is attached.  The Bids were received
from:
1. S & S Builders LLC.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
2. Reiman Corp.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.
3. Simon Contractors.  Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The bids were reviewed by Doug Klahn (1% Construction) and his recommendation is to accept
the lowest responsive bid from Reiman Corp., Cheyenne, Wyoming.

The total Bid Award amount is $935,576.50

Funding:
020-26-2616-42-43492 (1% Sales Tax 19-22 / Misc. Concrete)
```

